00:00:05,179 --> 00:00:08,080
Rutherford Chang's CENTS begins with a discrepancy.

4
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:11,919
A penny is photographed, catalogued, and inscribed.

5
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:13,519
The object persists.

6
