The record of the object persists.

7
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:18,239
What goes missing is the link between them.

8
00:00:18,679 --> 00:00:20,399
That gap is not an error in the work.

9
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:22,199
It is the work's newest layer.
